China is building a fortress against  coronavirus one that extends beyond its  borders earlier this week the Chinese  government announced it would ban all  foreigners from entering in 24 hours  time we raced to get from Seoul in South  Korea back home to Beijing your  temperature has to be below 37 degrees  to board and they keep checking flying  to another country is now like traveling  to another reality  these aren't health workers their cabin  crew another temperature check  mid-flight  we landed in Dalian in northeast China  customs officials also in full  protective gear checked every passenger  [Music]  here at the ramparts an army of  officials in full medical armor an  outlying fortification to make sure the  capital Beijing hundreds of miles away  is kept safe every passenger was tested  for covert 19 including our producer  Michael Greenfield  swabbing the back of the throat then the  back of the nose it is as uncomfortable  as it looks  we made it onto Chinese soil for hours  before the ban on foreigners came into  effect so we made it into town about  three hours before the deadline for  foreigners getting in as a pretty  comprehensive process when you do arrive  here first on the plane there are checks  temperature checks and then everyone  goes off the plane has a health  interview and then you're given a covert  test yourself a swab in the back of the  throat up the nose my eyes might have  watered a little now we're waiting to  hopefully reboard the flight back to  Beijing and people don't have symptoms  I've got a seat number here that was my  seat on the plane this is where I'm  sitting everyone's being told to sit  apart we've been given a meal but they  are taking this extremely serious is a  very very thorough quiet actually an  impressive process  but we would not be going to Beijing a  new policy instead we were bused to a  local hotel requisitioned by the Chinese  state where we'd be quarantined for two  weeks we queued according to the  markings for social distance and paid  for our rooms the rate included meals  delivered three times a day left outside  our door so this is it's 340 RMB per  night it's about just under 40 pounds  and it is home for the next 14 days the  next day our covert 19 tests came back  negative in action and cover-up marred  China's response to the outbreak inside  its borders now the virus is a foreign  menace they'll go to every length to  keep it at bay  Tom Cheshire Sky News Dalian
 

